 dde-grand-search (>= 6.0.0)
Description: DDE Grand Search plugin - find and open recent IDE projects
 Searcher plugin for dde-grand-search that finds recent projects of
 installed IDEs (VS Code family, JetBrains family) and opens them with
 the corresponding IDE.
 .
 The plugin registers as org.deepin.grandsearch.ideproject and is
 activated automatically by the search daemon. After installation,
 restart the search daemon (killall dde-grand-search-daemon) or
 re-login for the plugin to take effect.
